"Sebagian rentang ini lebih tua dari jendela penyimpanan (%(months)s bulan). "
"Pembersihan mingguan akan menghapusnya lagi; naikkan Penyimpanan di Settings"
" untuk menyimpannya."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid ""
"Presenly SaaS subscription is not active (status: %(status)s). Renew the "
"subscription, or ask a Presenly SaaS manager to review the connection "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Langganan Presenly SaaS tidak aktif (status: %(status)s). Perpanjang "
"langganannya, atau minta manajer Presenly SaaS memeriksa pengaturan "
"koneksinya."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Pull finished: %s"
msgstr "Penarikan selesai: %s"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Reference data updated"
msgstr "Data referensi diperbarui"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Refresh failed"
msgstr "Penyegaran gagal"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Retries cannot be negative."
msgstr "Percobaan ulang tidak boleh negatif."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Subscription refreshed"
msgstr "Langganan disegarkan"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Subscription renews in %s day(s)."
msgstr "Langganan diperpanjang dalam %s hari."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "The Presenly SaaS connection is disabled."
msgstr "Koneksi Presenly SaaS dimatikan."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "The Presenly SaaS server answered."
msgstr "Server Presenly SaaS menjawab."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "The Presenly SaaS server has never confirmed this subscription."
msgstr "Server Presenly SaaS belum pernah mengonfirmasi langganan ini."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "The number of months must be at least 1."
msgstr "Jumlah bulan minimal 1."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "The subscription snapshot is up to date."
msgstr "Snapshot langganan sudah terbaru."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "This snapshot has no connection record to refresh from."
msgstr "Snapshot ini tidak punya record koneksi untuk disegarkan."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "This subscription is %s."
msgstr "Langganan ini %s."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Timeout must be greater than zero."
msgstr "Batas waktu harus lebih dari nol."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Trial ends in %s day(s)."
msgstr "Masa percobaan berakhir dalam %s hari."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid ""
"Employee number from Presenly. This is the key the sync matches on, so it is"
" only ever written by the sync. Changing it by hand makes the record "
"unmatchable, and the next sync would create a duplicate."
msgstr ""
"Nomor pegawai dari Presenly. Ini kunci yang dipakai sinkronisasi, jadi hanya"
" sinkronisasi yang menulisnya. Mengubahnya manual membuat record tidak bisa "
"dicocokkan lagi, dan tarikan berikutnya akan membuat duplikat."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid ""
"HMAC key used to verify incoming calls. Created by the Presenly server and "
"shown only through the registration call."
msgstr ""
"Kunci HMAC untuk memeriksa panggilan yang masuk. Dibuat server Presenly dan "
"hanya ditampilkan lewat panggilan pendaftaran."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Presenly will call %(url)s when an employee changes there."
msgstr "Presenly akan memanggil %(url)s saat ada pegawai berubah di sana."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid ""
"Presenly will no longer call this Odoo. Changes are picked up by the "
"scheduled pull again."
msgstr ""
"Presenly tidak lagi memanggil Odoo ini. Perubahan kembali diambil oleh "
"tarikan terjadwal."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid ""
"Random part of the receiving URL. Without it, anyone who guesses the path "
"could trigger a sync."
msgstr ""
"Bagian acak dari alamat penerima. Tanpa itu, siapa pun yang menebak "
"alamatnya bisa memicu sinkronisasi."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid ""
"Register this Odoo with the Presenly server so it is told when an employee "
"changes there, instead of waiting for the next pull."
msgstr ""
"Daftarkan Odoo ini ke server Presenly supaya diberi tahu saat pegawai "
"berubah di sana, tidak menunggu tarikan berikutnya."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "The Odoo employee record this row is linked to."
msgstr "Record pegawai Odoo yang tertaut ke baris ini."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "The `updated_at` Presenly last reported for this employee."
msgstr ""
"Nilai `updated_at` yang terakhir dilaporkan Presenly untuk pegawai ini."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid ""
"The `web.base.url` system parameter is empty, so Presenly has no address to "
"call. Set it in Settings first."
msgstr ""
"Parameter sistem `web.base.url` masih kosong, jadi Presenly tidak punya "
"alamat untuk dipanggil. Isi dulu di Settings."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid ""
"The mapped fields as they were at the last successful sync. Used to tell an "
"edit made in Odoo apart from an edit made in Presenly, without relying on "
"comparing clocks across two servers."
msgstr ""
"Kolom yang dipetakan, sebagaimana adanya saat sinkronisasi terakhir yang "
"berhasil. Dipakai untuk membedakan suntingan di Odoo dari suntingan di "
"Presenly, tanpa membandingkan jam dua server."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "This Odoo's receiving address, registered on the Presenly server."
msgstr "Alamat penerima Odoo ini, sebagaimana terdaftar di server Presenly."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "When this record was last written by the Presenly sync."
msgstr "Kapan record ini terakhir ditulis oleh sinkronisasi Presenly."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Presenly SaaS: HR Integration"
msgstr "Presenly SaaS: Integrasi HR"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Apply Employee Placements"
msgstr "Terapkan Penempatan Pegawai"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Sync Work Locations to Odoo"
msgstr "Sinkronkan Lokasi Kerja ke Odoo"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Send Work Location Edits to Presenly"
msgstr "Kirim Suntingan Lokasi Kerja ke Presenly"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Presenly Work Location ID"
msgstr "ID Lokasi Kerja Presenly"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Presenly Location ID"
msgstr "ID Lokasi Presenly"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Allowed Radius (m)"
msgstr "Radius yang Diizinkan (m)"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Attendance Type"
msgstr "Jenis Presensi"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Zona Waktu"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Latitude"
msgstr "Lintang"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Longitude"
msgstr "Bujur"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "One work location may only mirror one Presenly location."
msgstr "Satu lokasi kerja hanya boleh mencerminkan satu lokasi Presenly."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid ""
"One row per field per record; re-checking updates it instead of adding "
"another."
msgstr ""
"Satu baris untuk satu kolom per rekaman; pemeriksaan ulang memperbaruinya, "
"bukan menambah baris baru."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
msgid "Presenly Work Location (mirror)"
msgstr "Lokasi Kerja Presenly (cermin)"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:presenly_saas_hr.field_hr_employee__presenly_other_company_names
msgid "Also an Employee in"
msgstr "Juga Pegawai di"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:presenly_saas_hr.field_hr_employee__presenly_client_name
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:presenly_saas_hr.field_presenly_saas_employee__internal_company_name
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:presenly_saas_hr.view_employee_form_presenly
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:presenly_saas_hr.view_presenly_saas_employee_search
msgid "Branch"
msgstr "Cabang"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:presenly_saas_hr.field_hr_employee__presenly_client_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:presenly_saas_hr.field_presenly_saas_employee__internal_company_id
msgid "Branch Client ID"
msgstr "ID Klien Cabang"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:presenly_saas_hr.field_hr_employee__presenly_other_company_names
msgid ""
"Other companies where this same person is also an employee. Odoo keeps one "
"employee per company, while Presenly keeps one person (one nopeg), so a "
"person can appear here more than once. Shown so the reader knows the row "
"they are looking at is not the only one."
msgstr ""
"Perusahaan lain tempat orang yang sama juga menjadi pegawai. Odoo menyimpan "
"satu pegawai per perusahaan, sedangkan Presenly menyimpan satu orang (satu "
"nopeg), jadi satu orang bisa muncul lebih dari sekali di sini. Ditampilkan "
"supaya pembaca tahu baris yang sedang dilihat bukan satu-satunya."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:presenly_saas_hr.field_hr_employee__presenly_client_id
msgid ""
"The branch this employee is placed at, as an id on the Presenly side. Kept "
"next to the name so the branch stays readable even when no Odoo company "
"carries that id."
msgstr ""
"Cabang tempat pegawai ini ditempatkan, sebagai id di sisi Presenly. Disimpan"
" di samping namanya supaya cabangnya tetap terbaca walau tidak ada "
"perusahaan Odoo yang memakai id itu."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:presenly_saas_hr.field_presenly_saas_employee__internal_company_name
msgid ""
"Which branch this employee works for, as reported by Presenly. When Presenly"
" does not name one, the branch is the main company: the installation that "
"subscribes to Presenly."
msgstr ""
"Cabang tempat pegawai ini bekerja, menurut laporan Presenly. Kosong bila "
"Presenly tidak menyebutkannya pada pegawai itu sendiri; cabang yang "
"sebenarnya ada di resource penempatan, satu baris per pegawai dan klien, dan"
" itu belum disimpan di sini."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:presenly_saas_hr.field_hr_employee__presenly_client_name
msgid ""
"Which branch this employee works for, from their primary placement. Kept as "
"a field of its own instead of making the employee belong to the client "
"company, so the employee list stays in one company and remains visible "
"without the multi-company selector. Empty until a placement names one. Not "
"shown on the employee form: the Branches list is the one to read, because "
"this value is only part of it."
msgstr ""
"Cabang tempat pegawai ini bekerja, dari penempatan utamanya. Disimpan "
"sebagai kolom sendiri alih-alih menjadikan pegawai milik perusahaan klien, "
"supaya daftar pegawai tetap di satu perusahaan dan tetap terlihat tanpa "
"pemilih multi-company. Kosong sampai ada penempatan yang menyebutkannya. "
"Tidak ditampilkan di form pegawai: yang dibaca adalah daftar Cabang, karena "
"nilai ini hanya sebagian darinya."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: code:addons/presenly_saas_hr/models/presenly_saas_placement.py:0
msgid ""
"%(user)s can now work in %(companies)s, from their placements in Presenly."
msgstr ""
"%(user)s sekarang dapat bekerja di %(companies)s, dari penempatannya di "
"Presenly."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:presenly_saas_hr.field_hr_employee__presenly_client_ids
msgid "Branches"
msgstr "Cabang"

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:presenly_saas_hr.field_hr_employee__presenly_client_ids
msgid ""
"Every branch company this employee is placed at right now, taken from their "
"placements in Presenly. This is the current picture, so a branch leaves this"
" list when its placement ends. Access to the company, once given, is never "
"taken back by the sync."
msgstr ""
"Setiap perusahaan cabang tempat pegawai ini ditempatkan sekarang, diambil "
"dari penempatannya di Presenly. Ini keadaan sekarang, jadi sebuah cabang "
"keluar dari daftar ini begitu penempatannya berakhir. Akses ke "
"perusahaannya, sekali diberikan, tidak pernah ditarik kembali oleh "
"sinkronisasi."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:presenly_saas_hr.field_presenly_saas_employee__branch_ids
msgid ""
"Branches that are actually in effect, taken from the placements of the Odoo "
"employee this row is linked to. The employee payload only ever carries one "
"client, so this is where the full picture is. Left as a related field on "
"purpose: the list lives in one place, not two."
msgstr ""
"Cabang yang benar-benar berlaku, diambil dari penempatan pegawai Odoo yang "
"tertaut ke baris ini. Payload pegawai hanya membawa satu klien, jadi di "
"sinilah gambaran lengkapnya. Sengaja berupa field terkait: daftarnya hidup "
"di satu tempat, bukan dua."

#. module: presenly_saas_hr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:presenly_saas_hr.view_presenly_saas_employee_form
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:presenly_saas_hr.view_presenly_saas_employee_list
msgid "Integration Company"
msgstr "Perusahaan Integrasi"

